    - target: {fileID: 7825599151252161033, guid: f21d16bcfa43ab94081fdd1b5899033c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'The Mayor and the Gas Station Owner... that meeting wasn''t normal.
        A photo isn''t enough. I need proof of what they''re planning. If there''s
        anything, it''ll be inside the Mayor''s house. Documents, a phone, anything.
        Alright. Tonight, I''m getting inside the Mayor''s house. '
